# NPC skaters (npc spawn: four in the park): 30 s of them riding the rider lines with the autopilot,
# popping flips, grabs and grinds now and then, sometimes bailing and respawning. Only their npc*
# events reach the world; the player (standing at the spawn) sees nothing of them.
park soma
cmd 0 npc spawn
run 3600
expect event npcLand count >= 3
expect event npcTrick count >= 3
expect no event bail
expect no event comboLanded
